  Haste Self, Confuse Monster, and (skilled+) Detect Monster all 
can be pumped up usefully.  Invisibility and Levitation probably 
can too.

  Skilled Detect Monster keeps showing you the monsters for a 
number of turns after you cast it.  Using it and Haste Self works
well.  When the monsters stop showing up it's time to cast Detect
Monster and Haste Self a few times each.

  Knowing where every monster (mindless or not) is on the entire 
level at all times is like cheating.  No more surprise attacks.
Watching what monsters get spontaneously generated and where is 
also fun.




